      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL: percentage of time the GPU had at least one kernel resident. Busy is not the same as efficient; compare it with the graphics engine activity next to it.",
